WEBVTT

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:01.930
COME ON NOW.

00:00:01.974 --> 00:00:04.324
HURRY UP.
YOU'LL BE LATE.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.455
TRAIN'S LEAVING.
GO ON. GO ON.

00:00:05.499 --> 00:00:07.632
COME ON.
HURRY UP.

00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:15.248
COME ON, HARRY.

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:17.598
ONE MINUTE.

00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:24.561
THOUGHT YOU WERE
LEAVING

00:00:24.605 --> 00:00:26.651
WITHOUT SAYING
GOOD-BYE, DID YOU?

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.874
THIS IS FOR YOU.

00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:50.283
THANKS, HAGRID.

00:00:56.115 --> 00:00:58.421
GO ON. ON WITH YOU.

00:00:58.465 --> 00:00:59.858
ON WITH YOU NOW.
ON WITH YOU.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.686
OH, LISTEN, HARRY.

00:01:01.729 --> 00:01:04.471
IF THAT DOLT OF A COUSIN
OF YOURS, DUDLEY,

00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:06.473
GIVES YOU ANY GRIEF,

00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:09.302
YOU COULD ALWAYS,
UM, THREATEN HIM

00:01:09.345 --> 00:01:10.607
WITH A NICE PAIR OF EARS

00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:12.566
TO GO WITH
THAT TAIL OF HIS.

00:01:12.609 --> 00:01:14.002
BUT, HAGRID,

00:01:14.046 --> 00:01:16.701
WE'RE NOT ALLOWED TO DO MAGIC
AWAY FROM HOGWARTS.

00:01:16.744 --> 00:01:17.919
YOU KNOW THAT.

00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:19.616
I DO...

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:21.749
BUT YOUR COUSIN
DON'T, DO HE?

00:01:21.793 --> 00:01:25.057
EH? [CHUCKLES]

00:01:28.016 --> 00:01:29.801
FEELS STRANGE
TO BE GOING HOME,

00:01:29.844 --> 00:01:31.193
DOESN'T IT?

00:01:31.237 --> 00:01:33.543
I'M NOT GOING HOME.

00:01:33.587 --> 00:01:35.720
NOT REALLY.

00:01:35.763 --> 00:01:36.125
[WHISTLE BLOWS]

